	"overflowanimations.glintAffectsArmorTint.description": "Applies the overlay damage tint to glint rendering on the armor like in 1.8-1.14.4.\n\nRequires the \"Damage Tint Armor\" setting to be enabled.\n\nNOTE: Does not work with \"Improved Transparency\" enabled.",
